Dashwise SDK
============

This folder contains shared server-side data access modules used by Dashwise runtimes.

What it includes
- Reusable API data functions (authentication, app config, integrations, notifications, and related helpers).
- Logic that should be shared instead of duplicated across app server actions and background jobs.

Why it exists
- Keeps data-layer behavior consistent across services.
- Centralizes backend-facing logic in one place.
- Makes refactors and maintenance easier.

Import style
- Use package-style imports via the TypeScript alias:
	- `@dashwise/sdk/data/...`

Example
- `import { requireUserAuth } from "@dashwise/sdk/data/auth";`